EC%A3%BC+%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EC%9E%90%EC%97%B0%EC%9C%A0%EC%82%B0&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jeju.go.kr%2Fnature%2Fjeju%2Funesco%2Fjejuwnh.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.jeju.go.kr/nature/jeju/unesco/geo.htm\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">제주도 세계지질공원</a>. 《제주도청 홈페이지》.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC%EB%8F%84%EC%B2%AD+%ED%99%88%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC%EB%8F%84+%EC%84%B8%EA%B3%84%EC%A7%80%EC%A7%88%EA%B3%B5%EC%9B%90&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jeju.go.kr%2Fnature%2Fjeju%2Funesco%2Fgeo.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.headlinejeju.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=452394\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">원희룡 지사 \"기후위기는 생존문제...저탄소 녹색사회로 전환\"</a>. 《헤드라인 제주》. 2021. 6. 5.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%ED%97%A4%EB%93%9C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8+%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%9B%90%ED%9D%AC%EB%A3%A1+%EC%A7%80%EC%82%AC+%22%EA%B8%B0%ED%9B%84%EC%9C%84%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%94+%EC%83%9D%EC%A1%B4%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C...%EC%A0%80%ED%83%84%EC%86%8C+%EB%85%B9%EC%83%89%E